{"title":"Career Roadmap · Prepress Specialist","role":"Prepress Specialist","summary":"A Prepress Specialist prepares digital artwork and production files so they are technically ready for printing. The role sits between design/content creation and the printing press, ensuring that files meet production specifications before plates, cylinders, screens, or digital-print workflows are created.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Prepress Specialist prepares digital artwork and production files so they are technically ready for printing. The role sits between design/content creation and the printing press, ensuring that files meet production specifications before plates, cylinders, screens, or digital-print workflows are created."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Artwork inspection and correction"},{"text":"Preflight"},{"text":"Colour management"},{"text":"CMYK and spot-colour handling"},{"text":"Typography and font management"},{"text":"Image resolution and file preparation"},{"text":"Bleed, trim and registration setup"},{"text":"Imposition"},{"text":"Proofing"},{"text":"PDF/X preparation"},{"text":"Plate-making workflow"},{"text":"Packaging artwork preparation"},{"text":"Print-production troubleshooting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong direct alignment for B.Tech/B.E. Printing & Packaging Technology."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career stage","Typical focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Prepress Trainee / Junior Specialist"},{"text":"File preparation, preflight, colour, proofing"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Prepress Specialist / Senior Specialist"},{"text":"Complex jobs, automation, troubleshooting"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Prepress Lead / Production Specialist"},{"text":"Workflow optimization, quality and team leadership"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Prepress Manager / Production Technology Manager"},{"text":"Digital workflows, automation, process strategy"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during B.Tech","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Main focus","Skills to build","Proof of progress"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Printing foundation"},{"text":"Printing processes, graphics, colour, design fundamentals"},{"text":"Basic print-production project"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Digital prepress"},{"text":"DTP, image processing, typography, PDF preparation"},{"text":"Complete prepress portfolio"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Production workflows"},{"text":"Preflight, colour management, imposition, proofing, packaging"},{"text":"Printing-industry internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Advanced prepress"},{"text":"Automation, workflow systems, packaging, digital printing, quality"},{"text":"Industry-oriented final project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Printing and graphics foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"p","text":"Build understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Printing technology"},{"text":"Graphic communication"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"},{"text":"Basic computer graphics"},{"text":"Colour science"},{"text":"Materials science"},{"text":"Paper and substrate technology"},{"text":"Printing processes"},{"text":"Basic packaging concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Printing technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Offset printing"},{"text":"Flexographic printing"},{"text":"Gravure printing"},{"text":"Screen printing"},{"text":"Digital printing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the relationship:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Artwork","Prepress","Plate/Imaging","Press","Finishing","Final Product"]},{"type":"h","text":"Colour fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RGB vs CMYK"},{"text":"Additive vs subtractive colour"},{"text":"Colour gamut"},{"text":"ICC profiles"},{"text":"Spot colours"},{"text":"Pantone concepts"},{"text":"Colour separation"},{"text":"Dot gain"},{"text":"Registration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Print-Ready Artwork Preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a basic brochure, poster or label and prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Correct dimensions"},{"text":"CMYK artwork"},{"text":"Bleed"},{"text":"Crop marks"},{"text":"Fonts"},{"text":"Images"},{"text":"Print-ready PDF"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Digital prepress specialization"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the core technical stage."},{"type":"h","text":"Desktop publishing"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop proficiency in relevant professional software such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe InDesign"},{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Adobe Photoshop"},{"text":"Acrobat Pro"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand equivalent professional prepress tools where used by the employer."},{"type":"h","text":"Image preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Resolution"},{"text":"DPI/PPI"},{"text":"Image scaling"},{"text":"Colour conversion"},{"text":"Image compression"},{"text":"Transparency"},{"text":"Clipping paths"},{"text":"Retouching"},{"text":"Vector vs raster graphics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typography"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Font embedding"},{"text":"Font substitution"},{"text":"Kerning"},{"text":"Tracking"},{"text":"Leading"},{"text":"Text overflow"},{"text":"Missing fonts"},{"text":"Typography consistency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"PDF preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PDF standards"},{"text":"PDF/X concepts"},{"text":"Font embedding"},{"text":"Image resolution"},{"text":"Bleed"},{"text":"Crop marks"},{"text":"Overprint"},{"text":"Transparency"},{"text":"Colour separations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h",