]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Packaging Artwork Workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"Design an end-to-end workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Artwork","Preflight","Colour separation","Proof","Imposition","Production"]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Colour Management Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare colour reproduction across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Monitor"},{"text":"Proofing device"},{"text":"Digital printer"},{"text":"Offset printing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Automated Imposition"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop or evaluate an automated system for optimizing sheet layouts and reducing paper waste."},{"type":"h","text":"Four-year honours / extended pathway"},{"type":"p","text":"For an honours/research track, add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced colour science"},{"text":"Computer graphics"},{"text":"Digital image processing"},{"text":"Computer vision"},{"text":"Packaging engineering"},{"text":"Printing automation"},{"text":"Digital manufacturing"},{"text":"Workflow software"},{"text":"AI-assisted prepress"},{"text":"Research methodology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a stronger route toward prepress technology, workflow automation and R&D."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Core stack","Senior direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"Commercial Prepress"},{"text":"DTP + PDF + preflight"},{"text":"Prepress Lead"}],[{"text":"Packaging Prepress"},{"text":"Dielines + colour + trapping"},{"text":"Packaging Prepress Specialist"}],[{"text":"Flexographic Prepress"},{"text":"Separations + plates + colour"},{"text":"Flexo Prepress Specialist"}],[{"text":"Gravure Prepress"},{"text":"Cylinder preparation + colour"},{"text":"Gravure Prepress Specialist"}],[{"text":"Offset Prepress"},{"text":"CTP + imposition + colour"},{"text":"Offset Prepress Manager"}],[{"text":"Digital Prepress"},{"text":"Digital workflow + RIP + VDP"},{"text":"Digital Production Specialist"}],[{"text":"Colour Management"},{"text":"ICC + profiling + 