"Future model"},{"type":"flow","items":["Artwork","Automated Preflight","AI Validation","Automated Colour Management","Digital Workflow","Production"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest professionals will therefore understand both printing technology and digital workflow engineering."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Printing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Offset","Flexo","Gravure","Digital Printing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Prepress"},{"type":"flow","items":["Preflight","PDF","Imposition","Separations","Trapping"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Design production"},{"type":"flow","items":["InDesign","Illustrator","Photoshop"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Colour"},{"type":"flow","items":["CMYK","Spot Colour","ICC","Proofing","Colour Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging"},{"type":"flow","items":["Dielines","Artwork","Barcodes","Bleed","Regulatory Elements"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["RIP","CTP","MIS","Workflow Automation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Future skills"},{"type":"flow","items":["Computer Vision","AI","Digital Manufacturing","Data Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Year 1","Printing + Graphics + Colour Fundamentals","Year 2","DTP + Digital Prepress + PDF Production","Year 3","Preflight + Imposition + Colour Management + Packaging","Year 4","Workflow Automation + Digital Printing + Quality Control","Graduation","Prepress Specialist / Prepress Engineer","3–5 Years","Senior Prepress Specialist / Workflow Specialist","5–10 Years","Prepress Lead / Production Technology Specialist","10–15+ Years","Prepress Manager / Print Production Manager","15+ Years","Head of Print Technology / Production Technology"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For B.Tech/B.E. Printing & Packaging Technology → Prepress Specialist, the strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Prepress","Colour Management","Packaging Artwork","PDF Production","Imposition","Printing Technology","Workflow Automation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The key distinction is that a Prepress Specialist is not simply a graphic designer. The professional must understand how digital artwork behaves in an actual printing and packaging production environment, including colour separation, substrates, printing processes, imposition, trapping, proofing and production constraints."},{"type":"table","header":["247","UG","Engineering & Technology","B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Printing & Packaging Technology","Packaging Designer",""],"rows":[]}]}]}